WEBVTT

00:12:58.431 --> 00:13:00.956
waa markii aan helay---markaan kahor--

00:13:00.956 --> 00:13:05.384
(Qosol)(Sacbis)--

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.866
laakin marka kaliya aan aadka ula dhacay ugu badnaan

00:13:11.882 --> 00:13:13.915
waa marka kaliya aan ka ag jilay

00:13:13.915 --> 00:13:16.234
ninka usabeeyo sida balanbaalista

00:13:16.234 --> 00:13:17.603
misna qaniina sida shinida,

00:13:17.603 --> 00:13:21.099
misna qaba cudurka Laleemada hada ujareeya sideeyda oo kale,

00:13:21.099 --> 00:13:23.356
Muhammad Ali.

00:13:23.356 --> 00:13:28.542
(Sacbis)